extends layout

block title
  | About TravelMate

block content
  section.information-page
    .information-shell
      p.eyebrow About TravelMate
      h1 Personal travel planning, made easier to follow.
      p.information-lead TravelMate gives a travel agent and traveller one clear place to prepare, review and refine a trip proposal.

      .about-highlight
        h2 Built around a human travel agent
        p A travel professional brings together destinations, daily activities, proposed flights and estimated costs. Travellers can review the itinerary, understand its assumptions and ask for adjustments before deciding how to proceed.

      .about-grid
        article.information-card
          span.product-icon(aria-hidden='true') 01
          h3 Clear itineraries
          p Days, places, activities and notes stay organised in a chronological plan.
        article.information-card
          span.product-icon(aria-hidden='true') 02
          h3 Transparent estimates
          p Flight and trip costs are labelled as estimates, with inclusions and exclusions shown alongside them.
        article.information-card
          span.product-icon(aria-hidden='true') 03
          h3 A shared review process
          p Travellers can review a shared proposal and give feedback for their travel agent to consider.

      .information-note
        h2 Team Members
        .about-grid
          article.information-card
            h3 Sanjay Kumar Devarai
          article.information-card
            h3 Sri Vishnu Vardhan Machidi
          article.information-card
            h3 Janardhan Reddy Kanala
          article.information-card
            h3 Dinakar Golla
          article.information-card
            h3 Venkata Harshavardhan Reddy

      .information-note
        h2 Planning support, not booking
        p TravelMate does not retrieve live fares, take payments or make reservations. A traveller’s confirmation does not book a trip. The human travel agent reviews the current proposal and manages its approval.
